    {
      "text": "In the mount of the Lord it shall be seen, Gen. 22:14. met him in the mount of God, Ex. 4:27. unto Moses … encamped at the mount of God, Ex. 18:5. Sinai … there Israel camped before the mount, Ex. 19:2. Come up to me into the mount … I will give thee tables of stone, Ex. 24:12. Moses turned, and went down from the mount, Ex. 32:15. Ye have dwelt long enough in this mount, Deut. 1:6. given him in mount Ephraim, Josh. 24:33. stand upon the mount before the Lord, 1 Kgs. 19:11. Lord will create upon every dwelling place of mount Zion, Isa. 4:5 (2 Ne. 14:5). Lord of hosts, which dwelleth in mount Zion, Isa. 8:18 (2 Ne. 18:18). place of the name of the Lord of hosts, the mount Zion, Isa. 18:7. worship … in the holy mount at Jerusalem, Isa. 27:13. Lord shall rise up as in mount Perazim, Isa. 28:21. in mount Zion and in Jerusalem shall be deliverance, Joel 2:32. saviours shall come up on mount Zion, Obad. 1:21. his feet shall stand … upon the mount of Olives, Zech. 14:4.",
